:''Not to be confused with [[Princess Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Princess Cat]].''
'''Cat Princess''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] introduced in [[Version 1.4 Update|Version 1.4]] and is obtainable during the [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event]]. It can be unlocked from any of the stages in [[Princess Punt Sweets Collaboration Event#Princess Punt|Princess Punt]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 27
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Cat Princess
|name2 = Cat Princess beauty
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Cat Princess beauty''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Cat Princess is nearly identical to [[Kerihime (Special Cat)|Kerihime]], the only difference between them being that Cat Princess has higher damage and DPS. But, once Kerihime's [[True Form]] is obtained, this unit becomes practically worthless. Wedding Kerihime has significantly higher DPS.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump & Rusher}}

