==Trivia==
*Even though Cat Princess and [[Princess Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Princess Cat]] may appear to have the same name in Japanese, that is not the case, as they use different words for "princess" (Cat Princess is Neko Hime, Princess Cat is Neko Ōjo).
*Cat Princess and [[Kerihime (Special Cat)|Kerihime]] share the record for taking the longest amount of time for a unit to be ported over from BCJP to BCEN, taking an astounding 10 years.
**Despite this, the names and descriptions for both units, excluding Kerihime's True Form, have existed in the game files ever since their addition, never being re-written in that time (which is why their descriptions resemble those of the original [[Battle Cats (Removed Game)|Battle Cats]]).

